---

This skill fetches and caches specification content that it does not own:

* RISC-V specifications published at https://docs.riscv.org are copyright
  RISC-V International and licensed CC-BY-4.0.
* The RISC-V Unified Database (https://github.com/riscv/riscv-unified-db) is
  licensed BSD-3-Clause-Clear, with CC-BY-4.0 documentation prose.

No specification text is redistributed in this repository. The bundled script
retrieves it at runtime into a local cache on the user's machine.
